---
/** Section boundary rendered as a YAML document separator: konfig emits one document per resource, one section per idea. */
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="flex w-full items-center">
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-800"></span>
  <span class="px-3 font-mono text-xs leading-none text-zinc-600 select-none">---</span>
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-800"></span>
</div>
